      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Harlem‑Irving Plaza opened in 1956 as a 337,000‑sq‑ft open‑air strip mall on a former stockyard, anchoring Norridge’s commerce.",
